    "number": 25,
    "summary": "Captive Judah will serve Babylon for seventy years—Various nations will be overthrown—In the last days, all the inhabitants of the earth will be at war.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "The word that came to Jeremiah concerning all the people of Judah in the fourth year of Jehoiakim the son of Josiah king of Judah, that was the first year of Nebuchadrezzar king of Babylon;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
